"/><text x=\"630\" y=\"705\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">Leaves, unimpressed by the Aristotelian diet</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"850\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"835\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">1605</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"855\" width=\"760\" height=\"110\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"855\" width=\"760\" height=\"110\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.13)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"630\" y=\"915\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">Advancement: a plan to reform the schools</text></g></svg>",
      "caption": "Bacon’s timeline from birth to Cambridge to The Advancement of Learning"
