      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><g font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Diagnose, Then Treat</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#cccccc\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">Bacon models ethics on the physician’s method</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The physician</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"210\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.13)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"259.2\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Constitutions</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"301.40000000000003\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">bodies differ</text><line x1=\"372\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"408,295 391.4,302.0 391.4,288.0\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"410\" y=\"210\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.13)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"560\" y=\"259.2\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Diseases</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"301.40000000000003\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">what goes wrong</text><line x1=\"712\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"748\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"748,295 731.4,302.0 731.4,288.0\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"750\" y=\"210\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.13)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"900\" y=\"259.2\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Cures</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"301.40000000000003\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">what heals</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#cccccc\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">mirrors</text><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"465\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"505\" stroke=\"#cccccc\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"550,505 543.0,488.4 557.0,488.4\" fill=\"#cccccc\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"545\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The moral philosopher</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"570\" width=\"300\" height=\"220\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.13)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"619.2\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Characters</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"661.4\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">tempers and</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"691.4\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">natures of</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"721.4\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">people</text><line x1=\"372\" y1=\"680\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"680\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"408,680 391.4,687.0 391.4,673.0\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\"/><rect x=\"410\" y=\"570\" width=\"300\" height=\"220\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.13)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"560\" y=\"619.2\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Affections</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"661.4\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">passions: the</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"691.4\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">mind’s diseases</text><line x1=\"712\" y1=\"680\" x2=\"748\" y2=\"680\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"748,680 731.4,687.0 731.4,673.0\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\"/><rect x=\"750\" y=\"570\" width=\"300\" height=\"220\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.13)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"900\" y=\"619.2\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Remedies</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"661.4\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">custom, habit,</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"691.4\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">example, books</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"830\" width=\"960\" height=\"170\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.13)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"880.4\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The mind is a calm sea</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"927.0999999999999\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">The affections are the winds that throw it into tumult</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"960.0999999999999\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">and perturbation.</text></g></svg>",
      "caption": "Constitutions, diseases, cures: the medical model behind Bacon’s ethics"
