" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Use</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"637.6\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">relief of man’s estate</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"820\" width=\"920\" height=\"180\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.13)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"878.1999999999999\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">Which answer holds all four together?</text></g></svg>",
